<h1>LIBERO Overdue Notice</h1>
<p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
<p>You currently have overdue loan(s):</p>
<ul>
  {{#each books}}
  <li>
    <strong>{{title}}</strong><br />
    Overdue days: {{overdueDays}}<br />
    Fine amount: {{fineAmount}}
  </li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>
<p>Total outstanding fine: {{totalFine}}</p>
